From bf1249814764b5a77f5de38d01c95e63d68d2950 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:18:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ui: draw launcher-independent overlay text (F1/F2 menus, pad
 labels) with the bundled vector UI font

ga2_ui_font.h rasterises Noto Sans JP at the pixel size drawn (one atlas per size,
glyphs added on demand), falls back to raylib's default font when the file is missing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
